OL,3,GNEWSA'Extraordinary' medieval site's
OL,4,Arefurb plan approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FA run-down 15th Century merchant's
OL,7,Fhouse in Oswestry is set to be restored
OL,8,Fand opened as a visitor hub.
OL,10,FThe work would remove "extraordinary"
OL,11,FGrade I-listed Llwyd Mansion from
OL,12,FHistoric England's Heritage at Risk
OL,13,Fregister, and create exhibition,
OL,14,Fcommunity and retail spaces.
OL,16,FMayor of Oswestry, councillor Jonathan
OL,17,FUpton, said it was a "significant step
OL,18,Fforward" for the timber-framed
OL,19,Fbuilding, which was bought by Oswestry
OL,20,FTown Council for #75,000 in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
