OL,3,GNEWSA'Extraordinary' medieval site's
OL,4,Arefurb plan approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt received lottery funding to pay for
OL,7,Fsurveys and urgent repairs last year,
OL,8,Fand is awaiting news on a #3.2m funding
OL,9,Fapplication to deliver the next phase.
OL,10,FShropshire Council has granted planning
OL,11,Fpermission for the restoration work.
